1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
Along the swollen veins you can see small knots.

2
00:00:03,478 --> 00:00:07,590
Each one is a valve, the flaps Fabricius found.

3
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:12,940
Harvey presses a finger on a vein and pushes the blood towards the hand.

4
00:00:13,157 --> 00:00:15,770
It stops dead at the next valve.

5
00:00:15,993 --> 00:00:20,820
He pushes it the other way, towards the heart, and it slides through easily.

